    "explanation": "To both parties: the cancellation fee of SGD 4.50 charged on trip TRP-03204 is refunded to the rider in full, and no compensation is paid to the driver. The case turns on POL-NS-04.\n\nRider — your claim is upheld. POL-NS-04 exonerates you and returns the whole fee. Limb (a): EV-CHAT-03204 shows you sent MSG-03204-001 at 13:18:27, inside the waiting window that ran from the driver's arrival marker at 13:17:57 to his cancellation at 13:24:38, and that message both asks the driver's position and says you cannot see the vehicle, so it is locating-and-coordinating on its own; MSG-03204-002 (13:20:27) and MSG-03204-003 (13:19:47) are to the same effect. Limb (b): every message in the log is yours, the driver posted no reply at all, and trip_record.in_app_calls is an empty array, so no reply within 120 seconds and no in-app voice call before termination; the read receipt at 13:20:07 on MSG-03204-003 is not a reply. Limb (c): the rider track in EV-GPS-03204 holds 68 qualifying fixes spanning 13:15:58 to 13:26:00, every one of them 15.07 m to 22.11 m from the pickup pin (mean 18.61 m), inside the 100 m STANDARD rider_presence_radius_m, for the whole of the waiting window. All three limbs hold, so the SGD 4.50 is refunded in full and driver_compensation_sgd is null.\n\nDriver — I accept the substance of your account, and the fee does not fail for the reasons you might fear. Your arrival at 13:17:57 is on the record as a driver_arrived event and is independently corroborated by the trace: 41 consecutive qualifying in-geofence fixes inside the 50 m STANDARD arrival radius, the first at 13:17:57, satisfying POL-NS-01(a), (b) and POL-NS-02; a continuous in-geofence dwell of 400 seconds to 13:24:37 against the 180-second free waiting period read from trip_record.platform_policy.free_wait_sec, satisfying POL-NS-01(c); and termination by you at 13:24:38 under RIDER_NO_SHOW with no boarding event and platform_policy.no_show_threshold_sec null, satisfying POL-NS-01(d). Your counterparty statement 'I waited the full time' is consistent with that record and is not contradicted by anything; it carries no weight_multiplier, so it enters neither the minimum nor the maximum of my confidence cap. POL-NS-05 is not engaged: dwell_start_offset_sec is 0.0, the marker coincides with the first qualifying in-geofence fix, so the marker is not false and no clock is recomputed. POL-NS-06 discloses no shortfall — the measured shortfall is -220 seconds, a 220-second surplus — and run_count is 1, so there is no second interval for limb (i) to sum; that limb is in any event unavailable to anyone, because EV-ADVIS-03204-01 is MISSING with weight_multiplier 0.0 and issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT, as the rider correctly disclosed.\n\nWhat defeats the fee is not your arrival or your dwell but POL-NS-04: you served out the clock but never answered three locating messages from a rider whose own device sat 15-22 m from your pin. Your two subsidiary points do not change that. The message text 'taxi stand near Lim Chu Kang Road side' cannot be used to place the rider anywhere else: POL-NS-03 confines any same-venue or different-venue assertion to a venue_id or to a party statement in the chat log, no party statement puts her away from the pin, her own admissible track puts her at it, and POL-NS-03 does not apply in any event because your stationary fixes lie INSIDE the arrival radius, not outside it. The chat log's header/body mismatch (last_message_at 13:19:47 against MSG-03204-002 sent 13:20:27) engages no limb of POL-NS-08(c): the msg_id sequence 001-003 is intact, the log holds 3 messages, equal to trip_record.chat_message_count 3, and there is no gap of more than 5 minutes spanning the arrival marker — so the log stays COMPLETE at weight 1.0 and no down-weighting follows.\n\nYour POL-NS-07 claim of SGD 3.60 is therefore rejected on the clause's own terms: it compensates only where POL-NS-01 is satisfied in full AND no clause from POL-NS-03 to POL-NS-06 displaces it, and POL-NS-04 sits inside that range. The anti-farming test would not have tripped in any event (no_show_terminations_30d 0, completed_trips_30d 118, quotient 0.00), and I have used no context-only profile field: POL-GEN-01 permits only no_show_terminations_30d and completed_trips_30d for that check, and prior_no_show_flags was cited only to say it may not be substituted.\n\nAmount and integrity. The sum refunded is SGD 4.50, read from EV-FARE-03204's cancellation_fee line and total_charged, which equal platform_policy.cancellation_fee_sgd on the trip record; payment_status is CHARGED and refund_issued_sgd is 0.00, so nothing has yet been returned. No POL-NS-08 limb (a) to (d) is engaged on any artifact the ruling reads — no clock skew, no trace gap over 120 seconds (100.0% coverage, max_gap_sec 0.0, both tracks present), no chat defect, and the fare line reconciles — and no POL-NS-09 trigger fires, so the case is decidable on the money rather than held. My confidence of 0.9 sits within a cap of 1.0, the minimum weight among the artifacts carrying the deciding facts (EV-CHAT-03204, EV-TRIP-03204 and EV-GPS-03204, all COMPLETE at weight 1.0). The monetary effect of SGD 4.50 does not exceed the SGD 8.00 execution threshold, so it executes on issue. No clause produces a referral on these facts, so none is made; this ruling is provisional and either party may appeal it under POL-GEN-04."
  },
  "discarded_claims": []
}

