gaged because the first in-geofence fix coincides with the marker (dwell_start_offset 0.0). Those findings make out POL-NS-01, but POL-NS-07 compensates you only where POL-NS-01 is satisfied 'and no clause from POL-NS-03 to POL-NS-06 displaces it' - POL-NS-04 is such a clause, so the claimed 3.60 (80 percent of 4.50) is not payable and driver_compensation_sgd is null.\n\nThe points raised for the driver do not change this. The rider's naming of 'the taxi stand near Lim Chu Kang Road side' does not defeat limb (a) or place her away from the pin: limb (a) turns on the content being locating/coordinating, her track keeps her within 22 m of the pin throughout, and POL-NS-03 confines any assertion that two places are the same venue, block or entrance to a venue_id or a party statement in the chat log - no inference from general geographic knowledge is permitted. The chat log's header (last_message_at 13:19:47) disagrees with MSG-03204-002 (sent 13:20:27), but that anomaly meets none of the POL-NS-08(c) chat defects (msg_id sequence intact, message_count 3 matching trip_record.chat_message_count 3, no 5-minute gap) and is immaterial, because neither message drew a reply.\n\nWeights: the facts that decide this refund - the rider's messages, the driver's silence, the rider's presence - are carried by EV-CHAT-03204, EV-GPS-03204 and EV-TRIP-03204, each COMPLETE at weight_multiplier 1.0, so the POL-GEN-02(2) cap is 1.0 and confidence 0.90 stands above the 0.70 floor. EV-ADVIS-03204-01 (TRAFFIC_ADVISORY) is MISSING with weight 0.0 and issue MISSING_ARTIFACT, as disclosed; nothing in this ruling rests on it - POL-NS-06(i) cannot be run on a missing advisory and is moot in any event, since there is a single unbroken 400-second run. driver_profile.prior_no_show_flags is context only under POL-GEN-01 and was not used; POL-NS-07's anti-farming check reads no_show_terminations_30d (0) and the 0.00 quotient and does not trip. No POL-NS-09 trigger fires, so the case is decided rather than held, and no referral is produced: POL-NS-05(ii) does not fire because the arrival marker is not false and qualifying in-geofence fixes exist, and no other clause directs one.\n\nThe monetary effect, SGD 4.50, is below the POL-GEN-05 execution threshold of SGD 8.00, so this provisional ruling executes on issue; either party may appeal once under POL-GEN-04."
